      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "3. Even though a clearinghouse is trying to resolve problems and is holding conferences, if a city agency wishes to expedite its application to the federal agency, the city agency may (once it has complied with the letter of intent procedures) send its formal application to that clearinghouse for comment. Thirty days after the clearinghouse receives the application, the city agency is entitled to send its formal application to the federal agency, provided it has completed A-95 procedures for the other clearinghouse.",
